{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52442","headline":"回波乐 八十五 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"父母怜（一作「烚」）男女，保爱（一作「受」）掌中珠。\n亦（张改作「一」）死手遮面，将衣即覆头。\n死朴哭真鬼，连夜不知休。\n天明奈何（张改作「河」）送，埋着棘嵩丘（一作「高坵」）。\n耶娘肠（一作「腹」）寸断，曾祖共悲愁。\n独守丘荒界（一作「野」），不知春夏秋（冬）。\n但知坟下睡，万事不能忧。\n寒食[墓]（慕）边哭，却被鬼耶（一作「邪」）由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}